WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.990
Run /showhow install once.

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:06.270
Then type one command, and get a narrated video of your project,

3
00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.920
straight from the code.

4
00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:11.950
It inspects your code and docs, plans a script,

5
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.840
builds the voice and the scenes, and renders the video.

6
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.490
Three modes. A how-to for one task,

7
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.080
an update for a release,

8
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.950
or a general video for anything outside your code.

9
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.290
Then tune it. One of eleven styles,

10
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.240
a theme, a voice, the format,

11
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.270
and switches for voice, captions, music, and sound.

12
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:34.860
You get the video, captions, chapters,

13
00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.050
a written guide, and a post to share it.

14
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.970
Add the skill, run /showhow install,

15
00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.570
then /showhow options to see everything.
